⚡ CONCEPTUAL VIVA QUESTIONS
❓ Why use try-catch here?
👉 To handle runtime errors without crashing program.
❓ Difference between checked and unchecked exceptions?
👉 This program uses unchecked exceptions (runtime).
❓ Why throw exception manually?
👉 To enforce business rules (invalid deposit/withdrawal).
❓ Why ArithmeticException?
👉 To represent insufficient balance logically.
❓ Why IllegalArgumentException?
👉 For invalid input values.
❓ What happens if exception is not handled?
👉 Program crashes immediately.
❓ Why use switch-case?
👉 To handle multiple menu options cleanly.
❓ Why use do-while?
👉 Ensures menu runs at least once.
❓ Why Scanner used?
👉 To take user input.
❓ What is real-world use?
👉 Banking apps, ATM machines, payment systems.
